; Hit box of the player (2-pixel units)
;
; The rectangle in which the player can be hit, rebuilt every frame by #R$A8A5 from the player's position and state
; (smaller while crouching: X+1..X+8 and Y+7..Y+13; otherwise X+2..X+6 and Y+2..Y+12, with X, Y the high bytes of
; #R$A8A1/#R$A8A3). #R$A851/#R$A85F compare the box of each entity with it as words: the first word is (min X, max X),
; the second (min Y, max Y) with the maximum in the low byte; an entity hits when its X range reaches min X and starts
; below max X, and likewise for Y.
; .
; +0 byte PlayerBoxXMax: right edge
; +1 byte PlayerBoxXMin: left edge
; +2 byte PlayerBoxYMax: bottom edge
; +3 byte PlayerBoxYMin: top edge
@label=PlayerBoxXMax
g$8516 DEFB $00
@label=PlayerBoxXMin
 $8517 DEFB $00
@label=PlayerBoxYMax
 $8518 DEFB $00
@label=PlayerBoxYMin
 $8519 DEFB $00
